<!-- DIVIDER — a hairline rule.

     ⚠ Structure in this design comes from hairlines and typographic hierarchy, never from card-style
     containers (constitution Principle V; spec FR-014). This is the block that does that work.

     Rendered by MJML as a bordered <p> inside a td rather than a CSS `border` on a content element,
     which is what makes it survive the Word engine's unreliable border handling. -->
<mj-section padding="0 32px">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-divider />
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
